===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*teng-|id=think}}
From {{inh|en|enm|thought}}, {{m|enm|ithoȝt}}, from {{inh|en|ang|þōht}}, {{m|ang|ġeþōht}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*þą̄ht}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*þanhtaz}}, {{m|gem-pro|*gaþanhtą||thought}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*teng-||to think}}. Cognate with {{cog|sco|thocht||thought}}, {{cog|stq|Toacht||thought}}, {{cog|fy|oandacht|dacht|attention, regard, thought}}, {{cog|nl|gedachte||thought}}, {{cog|de|Andacht|Andacht|reverence, devotion, prayer}}, {{cog|is|þóttur||thought}}. Related to [[thank]].

